      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm trying to run this macro for our monthly reconciliation but it keeps crashing. i keep getting this error: \"Run-time error '1004': Application-defined or object-defined error\". \n\nhere is the code:\n\nSub MonthlyRecon()\n    Dim ws As Worksheet\n    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Sheets(\"Recon_Temp\")\n    \n    Dim lastRow As Long\n    lastRow = ws.Cells(ws.Rows.Count, \"A\").End(xlUp).Row\n    \n    For i = 2 To lastRow\n        If ws.Cells(i, 3).Value > 1000 Then\n            ws.Cells(i, 4).Value = \"REVIEW\"\n            ws.Range(\"A\" & i & \":D\" & i).Interior.Color = vbYellow\n        End If\n    Next i\n    \n    ws.Range(\"A1:D1\").Select\nEnd Sub",
